  <p>The dates will be given and uploaded as per the guidelines of the university.</p>

  <b>Postgraduation</b>
  <p>The Students those willing to appear for M.Sc. as well as M.C.A. Entrance Exam. having Mathematics at 10+2 level need not apply separately. These students can mention about both these Entrance Examinations in the same Examination Form.
	<br/>
	At the time of Submission of Entrance Examination Form, submit two passport size photographs, students should collect their admit card immediately.</p>

	<p>
		<b>How to apply :</b>The candidates are required to apply in the prescribed form available from the college during office hours at Rs.250/- for Entrance Examination. (Rs.300/- if required by post, D.D. must be drawn in the favour of the <b>'Prinicipal, Prof. Ramkrishna More Arts, Commerce and Science College, Akurdi, Pune -44')</b>
	</p>

	<p>
		<b>Entrance Examination is mandatory for admissions to all above mentioned courses.</b>
